{
  "description": "Vectors of the hand-off from the v2 web apps (app. and dashboard.swiss-bitcoin-pay.ch) to the sattle.me web app. 1. The v2 page asks: `requests` (after sattle.me's address). 2. sattle.me sends back to this v2 app's `fetchPath` page, the nonce in the fragment (`#n=<nonce>`). 3. The v2 page answers: `payload` (keys in this order), as `fragment` after sattle.me's address; `expected`: what sattle.me keeps of it, with this nonce only.",
